*> Corrigé TP1.1 : carte de visite
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TP11.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NOM      PIC X(15) VALUE "DUPONT".
01 WS-PRENOM   PIC X(12) VALUE "Jean".
01 WS-METIER   PIC X(25) VALUE "Developpeur COBOL".
01 WS-VILLE    PIC X(15) VALUE "Lyon".
01 WS-TEL      PIC X(14) VALUE "06 12 34 56 78".
01 WS-LIGNE    PIC X(40) VALUE ALL "*".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY WS-LIGNE
    DISPLAY "* " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PRENOM) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-NOM)
    DISPLAY "* " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-METIER)
    DISPLAY "* " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-VILLE) " - " WS-TEL
    DISPLAY WS-LIGNE
    STOP RUN.
